&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with clients to assess IT needs and recommend practical, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support solution scoping and technical design during client engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and coordinate infrastructure refresh and renewal cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client relationships with professionalism, empathy and responsiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute infrastructure projects and resolve day-to-day technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and support servers, networking equipment and end-user systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue developing your expertise through training and certification paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with teammates to deliver high-quality outcomes for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Dell EMC server hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Microsoft Windows Server and Microsoft 365 technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of switching and routing concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of desktop operating systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with antivirus or endpoint protection solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What We’d Like You to Have&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CCNA, VMware or Microsoft certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Server virtualization experience (VMware or Hyper-V)&lt;/li&gt;
